Hi {Owner},

I build niche websites for real estate teams around {City}. {Business Name} has strong sales on social, but no page of its own where a buyer searching your neighbourhoods or a seller comparing agents can find you.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a facts-only neighbourhood page with current listings, a home value request with a plain disclaimer, a listing plan preview for sellers, a buyer agreement explainer and a brokerage disclosure block, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

It sits beside your brokerage site rather than replacing it. If you'd like it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and listing updates. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
